OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is a council leader facing
OL,4,Alosing her job after four months?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 19 May Labour's Tahmina Saleem was
OL,7,Fappointed as the new leader of Luton
OL,8,FBorough Council, replacing Hazel
OL,9,FSimmons who had been in charge since
OL,10,F2007.
OL,12,FSo why is Saleem now facing a
OL,13,Fleadership challenge at an
OL,14,Fextraordinary meeting being held less
OL,15,Fthan four months later?
OL,17,FThe BBC reviews the past six months at
OL,18,Fthe authority.
OL,20,FIn March Simmons announced that she
OL,21,Fwould be standing down as leader.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
